                      "fill": "#575757",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Hi, I’m Julia. I believe everyone deserves a safe space to talk, heal and grow. My work begins with listening to how life feels for you, rather than expecting you to arrive with a perfect explanation.",
