                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#575757",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "You may want to talk about worries, pressure, or the way you speak to yourself. You do not need to give your experience a label before asking about support.",
