                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "#575757",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "You can begin with a question, a situation, or a simple description of what prompted you to get in touch. If it helps, write down a few things you would like to mention. You do not need to send a detailed personal history in an initial contact form.",
